 "context": [
  {
   "h": "Psyche's revenge",
   "body": "<p>Psyche's sisters were married to kings in other cities, and their jealousy of her rich and mysterious marriage drove them to persuade her that her husband was a monster. Now Psyche turns their own weapon, deceit, against them. The story she tells in this section and the next is partly invented, and designed to lure each sister to her death.</p>"
